    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Manajemen Data: Add & Edit",
      "id": "add-edit",
      "intro": "Melalui Add & Edit Dialog (berupa drawer panel di sisi kanan layar), Anda dapat menambahkan entitas baru ke White List atau mengubah informasi entitas yang sudah ada. Form ini terdiri dari 6 field: Attribute (Select dropdown), Attribute Value, Date From, Has Expiration Date (Switch), Date To, dan Reason (Textarea).",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Membuka Form Create / Edit",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Tambah Baru (Add):** Klik tombol **Add Item** di toolbar kanan atas. Drawer *Create White List* akan muncul dari sisi kanan.\n• **Ubah Data (Edit):** Klik salah satu White List untuk membuka Detail Panel, lalu klik tombol **Edit Entry** (ikon pensil).\n• Drawer menampilkan judul **Create White List** atau **Edit White List**, badge *Add* atau *Edit*, dan subtitle *Fill details and save changes*.",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fdf4,#dcfce7);\"><div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:8px;background:#10b981;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Create White List</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Fill details and save changes</div></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:12px;background:#dcfce7;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">● Add</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:2px;\">White List Information</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Attribute <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border:1.5px solid #10b981;border-radius:7px;font-size:11px;color:#0f172a;background:#f0fdf4;\">IP_ADDRESS</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Attribute Value <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:7px;font-size:11px;color:#0f172a;\">192.168.1.100</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Date From <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:7px;font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;\">📅 Pick a date</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:7px 10px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:7px;background:#f8fafc;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Has Expiration Date</div><div style=\"width:32px;height:18px;border-radius:9px;background:#cbd5e1;position:relative;\"><div style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;position:absolute;top:2px;left:2px;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);\"></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#94a3b8;\">Date To</div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border:1.5px solid #f1f5f9;border-radius:7px;font-size:11px;color:#cbd5e1;background:#f8fafc;\">📅 Disabled</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Reason <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:7px;font-size:11px;color:#94a3b8;height:40px;\">Enter reason...</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;display:flex;gap:8px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:7px;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:7px;border-radius:7px;background:#10b981;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Create</button></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Pengisian Form",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:2}\nIsi seluruh field yang wajib (bertanda `*`):\n1. **Attribute** *(wajib)*: Pilih jenis atribut transaksi dari dropdown searchable (misal: IP_ADDRESS, CARD_NUMBER, MERCHANT_ID, dll). Data atribut diambil dari Transaction Attribute Master.\n2. **Attribute Value** *(wajib)*: Masukkan nilai spesifik dari atribut yang dipilih, misalnya `192.168.1.100` untuk IP Address atau `411111******1111` untuk Card Number.\n3. **Date From** *(wajib)*: Tanggal mulai berlakunya whitelist (menggunakan DateTimePicker lengkap dengan detik).\n4. **Has Expiration Date**: Toggle Switch — aktifkan jika whitelist memiliki tanggal kadaluarsa. Jika dinonaktifkan, field Date To akan terkunci otomatis.\n5. **Date To**: Tanggal akhir berlaku. Hanya aktif jika toggle Has Expiration Date dinyalakan.\n6. **Reason** *(wajib)*: Penjelasan mengapa entitas ini ditambahkan ke whitelist (textarea autosize, 2-4 rows), misal `Corporate office IP address - verified by IT Security`.\n\n> Setelah klik **Create** atau **Update**, entitas akan masuk ke whitelist dan dapat direferensikan oleh rule di Scenario Studio.",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "2": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.15);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#fff;width:300px;margin:0 auto;\"><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fdf4,#dcfce7);\"><div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:8px;background:#10b981;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a;\">Create White List</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Fill details and save changes</div></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:12px;background:#dcfce7;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">● Add</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:800;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:2px;\">White List Information</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Attribute <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border:1.5px solid #10b981;border-radius:7px;font-size:11px;color:#0f172a;background:#fff;\">IP_ADDRESS</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Attribute Value <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border:1.5px solid #10b981;border-radius:7px;font-size:11px;color:#0f172a;background:#fff;\">192.168.1.100</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Date From <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border:1.5px solid #10b981;border-radius:7px;font-size:11px;color:#0f172a;background:#fff;\">📅 2024-01-15 08:30:00</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:7px 10px;border:1.5px solid #10b981;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Has Expiration Date</div><div style=\"width:32px;height:18px;border-radius:9px;background:#10b981;position:relative;\"><div style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;position:absolute;top:2px;right:2px;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);\"></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Date To</div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border:1.5px solid #10b981;border-radius:7px;font-size:11px;color:#0f172a;background:#fff;\">📅 2024-12-31 23:59:59</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;\">Reason <span style=\"color:#ef4444;\">*</span></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;border:1.5px solid #10b981;border-radius:7px;font-size:11px;color:#0f172a;height:40px;background:#fff;\">Corporate office IP address - verified by IT Security</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;display:flex;gap:8px;\"><button style=\"flex:1;padding:7px;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;\">Cancel</button><button style=\"flex:1;padding:7px;border-radius:7px;background:#10b981;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(16,185,129,.3);\">Create</button></div></div>"
          }
